      "writtenOn": "2026-07-20T18:21:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "yeah we could definitely do that. One of my goals was to minimize code churn. `pkvm_{get,put}domain_cache_tag{un}assign` is used in couple other places(in legacy mode) as well and thought of not touching those. This was straightforward and confined to setup_fl. Will have a look and see how best to do it",
